WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Then <00:00:00.160>he <00:00:00.320>saw <00:00:00.560>trees,

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.540
their <00:00:01.880>roots <00:00:02.140>reaching <00:00:02.560>up <00:00:02.780>from <00:00:03.000>the <00:00:03.140>ground

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.280
and <00:00:04.260>wrapping <00:00:04.620>around <00:00:04.920>him,

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.360
threaded <00:00:05.700>with <00:00:06.020>gold.
